Postal ZIP decoding uses miniz_oxide 0.8.9 (raw Deflate), crc32fast 1.5.2
(CRC32), and miniz_oxide's adler2 2.0.1 dependency. We select the MIT license
option for each. Copyright notices and permission texts are reproduced in:

  code_deps/miniz_oxide-0.8.9/LICENSE-MIT.md
  code_deps/crc32fast-1.5.2/LICENSE-MIT
  code_deps/adler2-2.0.1/LICENSE-MIT

Only miniz_oxide's with-alloc feature is enabled. These libraries contain no
C backend, ZIP feature bundle, or time dependency. See Cargo.lock for versions.

